        "attribution": "Rose provided the key theoretical insight; Haider and Urban led the practical realization and demonstration. The proposed names represent the central theoretical and experimental contributions.",
        "maturity": "The correction is established in advanced microscopes and has produced extensive, independently verified scientific results.",
